<title>SYRIA: Syria tenders to buy 200,000 tonnes of cement.</title>
<headline>Syria tenders to buy 200,000 tonnes of cement.</headline>
<dateline>DAMASCUS 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syria's General Foreign Trade Organization for Metals and Building Materials (MAADEN) has issued an international tender to buy 200,000 tonnes of black cement, MAADEN officials said on Monday.</p>
<p>They told reuters February 19 was set as final date to receive price offers. The cement should be delivered by March.</p>
